{"id":1752,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><p>&nbsp; &nbsp;为迎接中北大学建校85周年，传承兵工红色底蕴，丰富校园文化生活，展现学院教职工精神风貌，环境与安全工程学院于6月26日举办“光影逐梦，校园寻踪”主题校庆摄影大赛。</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp;全院教职工积极参与，手持相机记录校园红墙绿树、科研实验室、课堂教学、团建交流等珍贵画面，用镜头捕捉校园景致与育人日常，定格教书育人、深耕科研的动人瞬间。作品兼具校园风光与岗位温情，饱含爱校荣校之心。</p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp;此次活动丰富教工文化生活，凝聚教职工向心力，以光影佳作献礼母校，彰显环安教师坚守育人初心、矢志科研报国的担当。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=AM4G1iLNVfMm-PUmmT7MznVnmNYLmNNPLmfRnR9inRA7Ml70gihFp2hmCIa0oSh2L1y8nkybM7LDL7-DLRn2UzGiU8CPU4LPLmvYL8WVLz6Fnl7sMmGinNMFLmLPU8UJqjfjo4OeoDA/_IVPgDTJQty0LzGsMYyPLzv4M1bw62T8c&oid=1384835319&tid=1077&nid=11736&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/9F24D94C60B604FA05CF1C312723BE17/EA7605FC/231CD\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=AMmf1fnzGiMznVMmNLDUlWVn77aMzfN7nm78ozMkU8UYL7-0gihFp2hmCIa0nkhVM1h7nkhVUzGbUzGanlCiozLaLmU8UlL8UmvPo77PnRWFMmA2nl-bnNnFLmU4ozrkgtXaQ4Oeo4xwqjTAvShXptQ0g47aM4v0Lz7sL4CJqdTnx&oid=1384835319&tid=1077&nid=11736&e=.jpg\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=Aozv1sMNlbUmfVLm4LPozLYnzG8MzUNaUlnfUm62nmNinlU0gihFp2hmCIa0L1yZLShfoSyYLRGaL4TVnm9sn7W7nmT2Mm9PUzvDLRGZMlrFozlinNQfLzfFozW7LmNJqjfjo4OeoDA/_IVPgDTJQty0LzGsMYyPLzv4M1bw62T8c&oid=1384835319&tid=1077&nid=11736&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/281A9200039EF87DBDF9F681A760085E/955FFA10/92D29\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=Anl-18MRQfLmMVUmNLDnmCaM8WRL7VNVLRrRnNL4U8C4Mz70gihFp2hmCIa0LYyiL1hRoShfLR74nmN8M7V2UzCaM7M2L7VRLmN4L77bn7rFnNrRnz7iMNQFM4rVLmlagtXaQ4Oeo4xwqjTAvShXptQ0g47aM4v0Lz7sL4CJqdTnx&oid=1384835319&tid=1077&nid=11736&e=.jpg\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=Aol71PUmA7nmlPomRQ2MNMRol-4nl7NDMmWkLmvDozG8LzU0gihFp2hmCIa0okhkokyiMkhfUz6Vnmv4MzN8LlVkL4-YL467UzWkLlWRL4QFL7VRLRNsLmAFUzVfMYb/v2veo4Oeq2XbC570qIbtpYyPLRvsg47PM4LDgtA8pUTcc&oid=1384835319&tid=1077&nid=11736&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/8B854AA7EF735941AB32237DA2B1BC36/0AC09728/A1A7\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"700\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach